spans.s:
पक्षस्, अस्, n. (said to be fr. rt. 1. पच्), a wing;
the side part of a carriage; the leaf of a door; the
wing of an army; a half, a division; a half month;
the side or shore of a river; a side.

पाक्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be cooked or matured;
fit to cook, eatable; obtained by cooking or evapo-
ration; (अम्), n. a kind of salt; (अस्), m. saltpetre.
